  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dougoum Garden Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Economic Opportunity (self-help grant) .The association would like to build a concrete wall around an already existing garden. At present, kids, camels, and other animals knock down the wall and get into the garden. The current earth wall also erodes when it rains and has to be rebuilt. The garden is perhaps a quarter of an acre, and would be enlarged slightly. There is also a water cistern that the association uses in order to have water for the garden.</narrative>
  </description>
